{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A SWINE WITH BRASS ACORNS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help PooPig on his quest, the hungriest and most selfish ever seen around these pastures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the (admittedly hilarious) army of General Otto Von Squirro and eat every last one of those acorns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/25959e2df4fdd0065fa14299a2094326.poster.avif?t=1769881306\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/25959e2df4fdd0065fa14299a2094326.webm?t=1769881306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/25959e2df4fdd0065fa14299a2094326.mp4?t=1769881306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DODGE. BOUNCE. SWALLOW.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although there are more unique stages, the bulk of the gameplay revolves around shooting, blocking and bouncing projectiles. Thanks to the shield, players can bounce oncoming enemies back and make them crash onto each other. Cause chaos acros the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every now and then, a holy saint pepper will show up. It can grant us a power up... or a curse (well, a penalty) depending on whether you grab it while it's green or red.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun with some silly breather sections in between bullet hell stages, such as fleeing from an overweight shark or flying through the underworld while turned into a sausage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/512b70408cd34611005b266eca20f0fe.poster.avif?t=1769881306\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/512b70408cd34611005b266eca20f0fe.webm?t=1769881306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/512b70408cd34611005b266eca20f0fe.mp4?t=1769881306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORK OF COMIC AND ANIMATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move, enemy and explosion has been animated the old school way: with tons of love, patience, and a sense of humor (tons of it)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is told via comic book panels which combine comedy and absurdism in a plotline that's as funny as unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poopig goes further from mere gameplay, offering a constantly surprising visual experience to keep players engaged with new gameplay mechanics, stages and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/f8ac99411ea55b116775edc65eb6ada6.poster.avif?t=1769881306\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/f8ac99411ea55b116775edc65eb6ada6.webm?t=1769881306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784140/extras/f8ac99411ea55b116775edc65eb6ada6.mp4?t=1769881306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare face those furrious squirrels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poopig is waiting for you...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3784140?t=1769881306","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co